            "feature": {
              "id": "second_wind",
              "name": "Second Wind",
              "description": "As a Bonus Action, you can regain Hit Points equal to 1d10 plus your Fighter level. You can use this feature twice. You regain one expended use when you finish a Short Rest, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest. Uses: 2 (levels 1-3), 3 (levels 4-9), 4 (levels 10-20)."
